{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Plan narrowed back after the previous revision passed review: push.py lines 120 and 189-190 (S3 preflight remote, push branch/remote) stay on the store's parent. Evidence: 6b96fd3d148 deliberately resolves the destination from the main repo (the tracker's parent), and the async push child runs with cwd detached_child_cwd(tracker) = store_repo_root (src/rebar/_proc.py:90-104), so moving line 120 to the caller's root would let the parent preflight a different remote than the child pushes to. Only sync.push (line 143) is caller policy. Re-reviewing the narrowed plan."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793534406603577001,"uuid":"2602f65a-64cc-4085-93ee-f0f367e275d6"}